// turnd's API. Served by a plain grpc.Server, over a WebSocket for browsers
// (github.com/grpc-transports/websocket). Only /login, /callback and /healthz
// are HTTP: an OIDC redirect cannot be an RPC.
//
// Authentication is gRPC metadata, never a URL or a message field:
//
//	authorization: Bearer <token>
//
// where the token is a turnd session token or an issuer access token
// (Credentials, CreateRoom), or a room peer token (everything else).
//
// Status codes: UNAUTHENTICATED (no or bad token), PERMISSION_DENIED (the
// token may not do this: a pending guest, a guest deciding), NOT_FOUND (no such
// room or peer, or a dead token's room), INVALID_ARGUMENT (malformed),
// ALREADY_EXISTS (a second stream for one peer), FAILED_PRECONDITION (already
